# This archive must round-trip byte-for-byte: MANIFEST.sha256 is re-verified by the
# safety doctor and gates the deletion of the original engine roots. The repo runs with
# core.autocrlf=true and the archive holds a mix of LF (303) and CRLF (316) files, so
# without this every LF file would check out as CRLF and its sha256 would no longer
# match. `-text` disables all end-of-line conversion while keeping diffs readable.
* -text
